Z||000009||Eric_PA||08-29-2000||06:30 AM||||That red Fastback with the 3.4 DOHC was Chris Schaefer's. That car is awesome. I recently met him in PA on his way through to some fiero event. I took off from work that day and as I was going down the main St. he went the other way. I just had to turn around and catch up. He stoped at a gas station I pulled in behind him gave the thumbs up with a great smile. He had the decklid up and that engine just looked great in there. We exchanged email adresses and he told me about the Kick Hill swap meet that ws coming up. It is so cool to meet people like this.||||reg||1
